{"seq":1,"slug":"threat-modeling","title":"威胁建模与攻击面","stage":"DONE","category":"cybersecurity-applied","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 威胁建模与攻击面 简介\n\n威胁建模是网络安全工程的核心方法论，它通过系统化地识别、分析和优先排序安全威胁，帮助组织在攻击发生之前建立有效的防御体系。在 2025—2026 年全球网络犯罪损失预计突破 10.8 万亿美元、勒索软件受害者同比激增 389% 的严峻形势下，威胁建模已从可选的安全实践升级为每个技术团队的必修课。\n\n本手册面向具有一定开发或运维经验的工程师和安全从业者，帮助读者系统掌握从威胁识别到风险量化的完整方法体系。无论你是刚接触安全领域的开发者，还是正在构建企业安全战略的架构师，都能从中获得可落地的知识框架。\n\n全书共分为四章，由浅入深地覆盖威胁建模与攻击面管理的关键领域：\n\n第一章**威胁态势**从攻击面分析的基本方法出发，梳理不同类型的威胁行为者分类体系，并深入解析 Cyber Kill Chain 与 MITRE ATT&CK 等杀伤链模型的演进脉络。\n\n第二章**建模框架**聚焦实用的威胁建模方法论，包括经典的 STRIDE 与 DREAD 评估模型、攻击树分析技术，以及端到端的威胁建模流程实践。\n\n第三章**漏洞管理**从漏洞的全生命周期管理入手，讲解 CVSS 评分体系（含 v4.0 的重大更新），并介绍企业级补丁管理策略。\n\n第四章**风险评估**覆盖定量风险分析方法、NIST/ISO 27001 等主流合规框架，以及零信任架构的设计原则与落地路径。\n\n建议读者按章节顺序学习，先建立威胁态势的全局认知，再掌握建模方法和工具，最后将知识整合到企业风险评估与合规治理的实际场景中。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"threat-landscape","title":"威胁态势","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/threat-landscape","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"attack-surface-analysis","title":"攻击面分析","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/threat-landscape/attack-surface-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"threat-actor-taxonomy","title":"威胁行为者分类","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/threat-landscape/threat-actor-taxonomy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"kill-chain-models","title":"杀伤链模型：Cyber Kill Chain 与 MITRE ATT&CK","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/threat-landscape/kill-chain-models"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"modeling-frameworks","title":"建模框架","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/modeling-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stride-dread-models","title":"STRIDE 威胁分类与 DREAD 风险评级","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/modeling-frameworks/stride-dread-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"attack-tree-analysis","title":"攻击树建模与分析方法","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/modeling-frameworks/attack-tree-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"threat-modeling-process","title":"端到端威胁建模实战流程","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/modeling-frameworks/threat-modeling-process"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"vulnerability-management","title":"漏洞管理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/vulnerability-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vulnerability-lifecycle","title":"漏洞全生命周期管理","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/vulnerability-management/vulnerability-lifecycle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cvss-scoring-system","title":"CVSS 评分体系深度解析","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/vulnerability-management/cvss-scoring-system"},{"seq":3,"slug":"patch-management-strategy","title":"企业级补丁管理策略","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/vulnerability-management/patch-management-strategy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"risk-assessment","title":"风险评估","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/risk-assessment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantitative-risk-analysis","title":"定量风险分析方法","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/risk-assessment/quantitative-risk-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compliance-frameworks","title":"NIST 与 ISO 27001 合规框架","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/risk-assessment/compliance-frameworks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"zero-trust-architecture","title":"零信任架构设计与实施","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/threat-modeling/risk-assessment/zero-trust-architecture"}]}]}